/ A reminder of the house rules with a link to the full Community Guidelines.
/ Locals: compact (default false). The full version heads the forum index; the
/ compact one-liner sits above the new-topic and reply forms.
- compact = local_assigns.fetch(:compact, false)

- if compact
  .guidelines-callout.guidelines-callout-compact.small.mb-3 role="note"
    strong Keep it friendly and clean.
    |  No profanity, label spoilers, no private info or spam.
    = " "
    = link_to "Community Guidelines", forum_guidelines_path, class: "fw-semibold"
- else
  .guidelines-callout.mb-3 role="note" aria-label="Community guidelines"
    .fw-semibold.mb-1 Before you post
    ul.small.mb-2.ps-3
      li Be respectful and keep it clean: no profanity. Critique the show, not the people.
      li No private info about anyone, and no spam or piracy.
      li Put [SPOILER] in the title for new episodes, and keep the spoiler out of it.
      li See a problem? Use the Report link on the post.
    = link_to "Read the Community Guidelines", forum_guidelines_path, class: "small fw-semibold"
